# NASA FIRMS MAP_KEY (free) - get one at https://firms.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov/api/area/
# Server-side only: set it in Vercel (Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables)
# or in a local .env file when running `vercel dev`.
# Never give it a VITE_ prefix - that would ship it to the browser.
FIRMS_MAP_KEY=
